## 0. VORBEDINGUNGEN (one-time, idempotent)

### 0.1 Environment
```bash
export PATH=/root/.local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY="${DEEPSEEK_API_KEY:?set DEEPSEEK_API_KEY env var}"
export OPENAI_API_KEY="${OPENAI_API_KEY:-$DEEPSEEK_API_KEY}"
