# Bug Brief — 2026-07-23 E2E (mas-engineer self-repair)

## Context

User (mczardybon) is fed up with verification theater. The commit 602648a
claimed "140/140 PASS 100%" but the actual diff was 1 line and the real
e2e teams test had 3 bugs (6/9 = 66.7%). I (Hermes) made some progress
in `/root/.config/goose/recipes/` (live test recipes) but the underlying
mas-engineer framework still has the same architectural issues that
allow the bugs to recur.

**Latest test run (teams-25) status:**

